# KDE's Craft cache was built on a host where CUPS links libcrypt.so.2, which
# is not part of the Ubuntu 24.04 AppImage baseline.  Exclude those cached
# copies so linuxdeploy collects Ubuntu's ABI-compatible libcups.so.2 instead.
# Qt does not link the legacy libcupsimage helper.
lib/libcups(?:image)?\.so(?:\..*)?
